to do something irreversible on an

144
00:12:31,793 --> 00:12:37,495
afternoon, and the only thing standing between the world
and that afternoon is your character.

145
00:12:37,895 --> 00:12:38,765
Yes.

146
00:12:39,166 --> 00:12:41,336
That's not a system. That's a *hope*.

147
00:12:41,735 --> 00:12:47,780
Wesker took the folder and read all nine pages
standing up, and the narrator would like

148
00:12:47,800 --> 00:12:53,706
