149
00:12:54,105 --> 00:13:00,346
He wrote: *Noted. You are correct. I have no
answer. — A.W., 9 January 2040.*

150
00:13:00,745 --> 00:13:05,918
And then he put it in the drawer with the other
three, and the narrator notes that it

151
00:13:05,938 --> 00:13:11,232
is the only document in that drawer which does not
have the word *overruled* on it, and

152
00:13:11,252 --> 00:13:14,653
